## 消息队列协议（你和朋友的接口约定）

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 这是你和朋友之间最关键的接口协议。你们只需要约定好消息格式和 Redis 地址，就可以独立开发。

### 任务消息格式（发布到 Redis 队列）

```json
{
  "taskId": "uuid-xxxx",
  "inputFileKey": "uploads/2026/04/10/abc123.mp4",
  "inputFileUrl": "https://your-oss.com/uploads/2026/04/10/abc123.mp4",
  "callbackUrl": "https://your-domain.com/api/internal/callback/task-complete",
  "createdAt": "2026-04-10T10:00:00Z"
}
```

### Worker 完成回调格式

```json
{
  "taskId": "uuid-xxxx",
  "status": "completed",
  "resultFileKey": "results/2026/04/10/abc123_result.mp4",
  "resultJson": {
    "frames_analyzed": 300,
    "detections": [...],
    "summary": { "left_pressure_avg": 0.62, "right_pressure_avg": 0.38 }
  }
}
```

### Worker 失败回调格式

```json
{
  "taskId": "uuid-xxxx",
  "status": "failed",
  "errorMsg": "Video format not supported"
}
```

### Redis 连接

- Mac Mini 的 Worker 通过**公网连接**到云服务器的 Redis
- Redis 需要设置密码 + 只允许特定 IP 连接
- 队列名称：`ski-inference-queue`

---

## 云服务器 Nginx 配置

```nginx
server {
    listen 443 ssl;
    server_name yourdomain.com;

    # SSL 证书 (Let's Encrypt)
    ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/yourdomain.com/fullchain.pem;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/yourdomain.com/privkey.pem;

    # 客户端前端 — 静态文件
    location / {
        root /var/www/skate-web/client;
        try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;
    }

    # 管理后台前端 — 静态文件
    location /admin {
        alias /var/www/skate-web/admin;
        try_files $uri $uri/ /admin/index.html;
    }

    # 后端 API — 反向代理到 Node.js
    location /api {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:3000;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        client_max_body_size 500M;   # 允许大文件上传
    }
}
```

